lg:NL-BW3-art15d-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "abc22902adc4a29460a1069516bf237e4d7467ed9d5d3a7ff32b0485de44f206" ;
    lgo:text """1 Anyone providing a service of the information society makes the following data easily, directly and permanently accessible to those using that service, in particular to obtain or make information accessible:
a. his identity and address of establishment;
b. data enabling rapid contact and direct and effective communication with him, including his electronic mail address;
c. in so far as he is entered in a trade register or a comparable public register: the register in which he is entered and his registration number, or a comparable means of identification in that register;
d. in so far as an activity is subject to a licensing scheme: the data on the competent supervisory authority;
e. in so far as he practises a regulated profession:
– the professional association or organisation with which he is registered,
– the professional title and the Member State of the European Union or other State party to the Agreement on the European Economic Area in which it was awarded,
– a reference to the professional rules applicable in the Netherlands and the manner of access to them;
f. in so far as he carries on an activity subject to VAT: the VAT identification number within the meaning of Article 2a(1)(g) of the Turnover Tax Act 1968."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NL-BW3-art15d-1-q1 .

lg:NL-BW3-art15d-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "75995e071b5a4793d19d7a28fa5d352dc31928d3a6c34b83f5a26ff916a389fb" ;
    lgo:text "2 The service provider indicates prices in a service of the information society clearly and unambiguously, expressly stating whether, and if possible which, tax and delivery costs are included."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NL-BW3-art15d-2-q1 .

lg:NL-HRW-art27-1-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "5828ee17942746b49368f2d30e3282d7bc6c22582ee177e2d78e64dbf04172fc" ;
    lgo:text """1 The following undertakings and legal persons entered in the trade register must ensure that the number under which they are entered in the trade register is stated on all letters, orders, invoices, offers and other announcements issued by that undertaking or legal person, with the exception of advertisements:
a. the undertakings and legal persons referred to in Articles 5 and 6(1)(a);
b. the legal persons referred to in Article 6(1)(b), unless documents are issued by a legal person to which no undertaking belongs."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NL-HRW-art27-1-q1 .

lg:NL-HRW-art27-2-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "a48841e96d011581c91c6512c6d8636f419308c37b2e14d74ca264fb7756951c" ;
    lgo:text "2 The number referred to in the first paragraph is the number referred to in Article 9(a) or Article 13(a)."@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NL-HRW-art27-2-q1 .

lg:NL-HRW-art27-3-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "7539f168bc7d0db504c32fa4efafe5265d09ea95fb5e9bb303ff04b397d208a8" ;
    lgo:text """3 An exemption from the provisions of the first paragraph may be granted by ministerial regulation. An exemption may not be granted:
a. to European economic interest groupings;
b. as regards letters and orders, to public limited companies, private limited companies and European public limited companies."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "devin" ;
    lgo:translatedOn "2026-11-14"^^xsd:date ;
    lgo:translationMethod lgv:MachineTranslation ;
    lgo:translationOf lg:NL-HRW-art27-3-q1 .
